----------------------\n- Micro-Layer : 5-10 processes per cycle, 2-20 min random rest, +10s delay ladder per task, 0-2s jitter.\n- Macro-Layer : 2-4 hours active window followed by 1-2 hours staggered deep rest hibernation per worker.\n- Concurrency : Zero database write locks, serialized SQLite write locks, WAL mode enabled.\n\n4. MASTER DOWNLOAD LINKS (11:00 AM BST / 05:00 AM UTC):\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Master Dashboard CSV (1,007 ideas): https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wwwxpQbGj6Wk/master_dashboard_27_sept_05.00_am.csv\n- Master Prompts CSV (12,363 prompts): https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wpwepMbJjKy2/master_prompts_from_db_27_sept_05.00_am.csv\n================================================================================\'\'\'\n\np = subprocess.Popen([\'curl\', \'-s\', \'--data-binary\', \'@-\', \'https://paste.rs\'], stdin=subprocess.PIPE, stdout=subprocess.PIPE)\nout, _ = p.communicate(input=audit_content.encode(\'utf-8\'))\npaste_url = out.decode(\'utf-8\').strip()\nprint(\'Audit Paste URL:\', paste_url)\n'
